===History===
DDoS attacks pre-date the smurf attack. I (dank) was the first person I knew implementing distributed denial of service attacks with several hosts. I used eggdrops/tcl to do this before anyone else that I knew. I dropped Havok's potential EFNet server with my DDoS network that I built fromm rootkited hosts. This was before the smurf attack =) About one year prior to this. It is said that DDoS began 1 or 2 years after the smurf attack was invented, this is not the case.